From c7a54ec041837af34d9c7149758dbcb75e90d4fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kaixin Liu <liukaixin1@h-partners.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 16:18:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] feat(cpu): add ARM SVE/NEON FP16 & FP32 matmul kernels

- ggml-cpu.h: expose matmul type-trait hook (matmul_f, matmul_outer_pack_t,
  is_matmul_valid) used by the new mul_mat dispatch path
- vec.cpp/h: add optimized matmul kernels for the bge-m3 workload
  - ggml_matmul_f32_4x4_kernel / ggml_matmul_f16_4x4_kernel (leftovers)
  - matmul_outer_packA family: 8x16/4x16 f16 + 8x16 f32 micro-kernels,
    neon f16 variant, pack-a driver with el_bits abstraction
  - ggml_vec_scale_f32: fix SVE predicated tail (loop in ggml_f32_epr chunks)
    so leftover elements past the first vector are always covered
---
 ggml/include/ggml-cpu.h   |   16 +
 ggml/src/ggml-cpu/vec.cpp | 1787 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 ggml/src/ggml-cpu/vec.h   |  116 ++-
 3 files changed, 1893 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

